  "name": "rhdh-smoke-tests",
  "description": "Walks RHDH smoke tests: inspect plugin-catalog-index OCI refs first, then Helm and Operator in parallel (one namespace each): install the previous GA, upgrade to this RC, then if this stream is not the newest, upgrade to the latest GA of the next minor. Sets Helm global.clusterRouterBase on every helm command (never --reuse-values). Prompts for an OpenShift console URL and oauth/token/display when oc is not logged in. Enables Guest via Helm upstream.backstage.appConfig or an Operator ConfigMap, then verifies pods, Guest sign-in, and extensions packages totalItems. Use for \"run the helm smoke tests\", \"operator RC smoke\", \"parallel helm and operator smoke\", \"catalog-index smoke\", \"plugin-catalog-index pull\", \"inspect catalog OCI refs\", \"clusterRouterBase\", \"console URL login\", \"upgrade 1.10.3 to 1.10.4 RC\", \"1.9.8 to 1.9.9 then 1.10\", \"GA smoke test\", or \"SMOKE_TESTS helm and operator\".",
